From bd83b7bd417127bba4f4c20c01c8f74f2db0e747 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 09:28:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add real magic-link login for buyers, vendors, and admin with
 session-linked profiles

Replaces the fake demo login/signup with Supabase Auth OTP email sign-in, links
each account to its Yoxa-created buyer/vendor record by email (no session
"claiming"), gates admin behind an allow-list, and adds editable profile +
progress pages for both portals.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BZibWYPysw75xiFQpbHszf
